            "review_title": "Review at Banh Mi Bui Thi Xuan",
            "review_text": "apmscheng\nBengaluru, India25 contributions\n0\nVery good Banh Mi\nApr 2020\nVery good choice of banh mi's and a variety of other Vietnamese food. Stuffed bao, rice cakes in leaves etc. very reasonable prices about 25K for the Banhmi pork. Always crowded and an indicator of popularity with locals.\nThis is a take away shop only and no inside seating. Can walk down the street and eat in the Taodan park about 100 meters away.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 2, 2020",
